e is rewritten — **inferred**. Same class of gap existed on base; this PR correctly fixes the **hot** reload case when `mtime` advances mid-migration.\n\n## Owner alignment\n\n- No fabricated netuids; reload still refuses empty shells (`{}`).\n- Shrink / refresh writer semantics unchanged.\n- Minimal diff scoped to reader reload guard.\n\nNo blocking findings (`never-expires`, `overflow`, `aborts-cycle`, `poisons-later-row`).",
