hip compute is slightly noisy; module-level import would match `is_worker_mode` pattern in the same file.\n- **guess:** Helper name/docstring would help future readers tie root exclusion to rule 3 vs scoring denominator.\n\n## Skills\n\n| Skill | Found | Changed |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| adversarial-review | Traced `_compute_membership` output through snapshot publish and coverage receipt filters; compared base vs head root handling | — |\n| owner-rules | Rules 1 and 3 checked against membership publish path | — |\n| settled-check | No settled doc in fixture; behavior matches existing `> 0` membership scoring seam in `snapshot_coverage.py` | — |\n",
