the goal is “focus the universe suite in CI” without changing default local behavior.\n\n## Adversarial / production paths\n\n**measured** No changes to `internal/subnet_universe`, chain probe, or receipt code in this PR. No new numeric inputs or persistence paths; nothing to trace for cycle abort / row poison / overflow.\n\n## Skills\n\n| Skill | Found | Changed |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| adversarial-review | No prod diff; skipped runtime extreme-value trace | — |\n| owner-rules | SN7 owner-rule test excluded from default pytest | — |\n| settled-check | No doc/lock in fixture stating SN7 integration may leave default suite | — |\n\n## Ask\n\nEither (a) scope deselection to CI only / marker, and (b) add a documented alternate job or explicit `-k sn7_off_chain` run for the receipt integration, **or** justify in PR body why builder tests suffice for the receipt inactive/expected split.",
