it only changes which tests pytest collects. No new path for grace expiry, float overflow, or cross-cycle poisoned state was introduced by the ini change.\n\n## Recommendation\n\nKeep the stability goal, but (1) scope the filter to the CI step or marker that owns universe tests, (2) document why T1 is unstable (or fix the test) and run it in a labeled job if it stays out of the default suite, (3) clean up the empty `test_subnet_universe.py` diff if accidental.",
